# Builds use the repository root as their context; data/ alone is tens of GB, so everything is excluded
# and each image lists what it needs. Airflow image: the lock and its wrapper. BlockPulse image
# (infra/k8s/Dockerfile): the lock, the package metadata and the source.
*
!requirements.lock
!orchestration/airflow/blockpulse.sh
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src
**/__pycache__
